** Their raise of a weak two-bid

The raise is preemptive, so the direct seat needs an opening hand to act at
the three level: a takeout double (13--17 and short, or any 18+), a five-card
major, a six-card minor at the four level, 3NT with 16--19 and a stopper.
In the balancing seat the same calls with 11+.

