** Balancing over a preempt

Over a three-level preempt passed round to us, the direct-seat methods
(`defense.bml`) apply about a king lighter: a takeout double with 11--17 and
shortness (or any 18+), a natural six-card suit with 11--17, 3NT with 15--20
and a stopper. Advancer answers the double as over the direct double.

